    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 193,
        "text": "Good evening, everyone. Thanks for coming to the community garden meeting. We need to decide how to use our small budget this season. As you know, we have 500 dollars from the local council.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "11a42fda44a44e81142cdaaa2b2b0427862ef7be36a69d8be4a2a36bbbd06fc6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 197,
        "sourceEnd": 299,
        "text": "Right. And we also have some money left from last year—about 120 dollars. So the total is 620 dollars.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "deaafae1ddf6805577b4722a2c0287fb1ea44cf2de0fce6da5dc2dc3c1d34d61",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 303,
        "sourceEnd": 493,
        "text": "Exactly. Now, last month we agreed to spend 200 dollars on new tools. But then the water pipe broke, and we had to pay 150 dollars to fix it. So we have 270 dollars left for everything else.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "bbf71dd003354c82c96108e3c56798da9aa8b2f49e83df43bec8a3205a577867",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 497,
        "sourceEnd": 582,
        "text": "Wait, let me check. 620 minus 200 is 420. Then minus 150 is 270. Yes, that's correct.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "8cd18eea99b9a52f5e080821b64aac43715118b5382ae8358f5172a36fac234c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 586,
        "sourceEnd": 736,
        "text": "Good. So what should we do with the 270? We have three possible projects: buying seeds, building a small shed, or renting a tiller for the heavy soil.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "2f93df703bf5f2270bf76a0e9a4384e098c3fa150a00044ffc5803c155bdb7d3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 740,
        "sourceEnd": 860,
        "text": "I think seeds are the most important. Without seeds, we can't grow anything. But we also need a shed to store the tools.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "0c9a286b6ac02ed9622ada30ac6957f4d1d0f65b4c4b5f166db3f166a36bd291",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 864,
        "sourceEnd": 1017,
        "text": "True. But a shed would cost at least 300 dollars, so we can't afford it this year. The tiller rental is 80 dollars for a week. That leaves 190 for seeds.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "9f664dda73c9c83014a3984dd3bc8edebc276aeffb0ef2155c10cb703e467cc1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1021,
        "sourceEnd": 1165,
        "text": "That sounds reasonable. But what about the compost? We need compost for the soil. Last year we made our own, but this year we don't have enough.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "33e76436d47ecf764d9eb8e06d115c0e53f28aece8c44800a6e99573b262fcf4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1169,
        "sourceEnd": 1269,
        "text": "Good point. Compost costs 50 dollars for a large bag. If we buy one bag, we have 140 left for seeds.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "a8d69ae78db2001ec8d8492a2a2f34395b6ff0db2f514b45bf2eb7d0f1963e6d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1273,
        "sourceEnd": 1398,
        "text": "OK. So the plan is: rent the tiller for 80, buy one bag of compost for 50, and spend the rest on seeds. That's 140 for seeds.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "262174b851b8a6e70b4409f6396a399fb6cdf91763a8dd032497855692f377d6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1402,
        "sourceEnd": 1547,
        "text": "Yes. And we should check our progress in two months—say, the first week of June. If the seeds haven't grown well by then, we can adjust the plan.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "7fe71e0869a1eb8feaa85847034e45596a055e346f243f1c79c9a326933062e2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1551,
        "sourceEnd": 1691,
        "text": "Agreed. Also, we need to remember that the council wants a short report at the end of the season. So we should keep receipts for everything.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "a5859b45eb871ef058aa844c4be10889155db28d3359dbc153c88dac9c4ea7d0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1695,
        "sourceEnd": 1853,
        "text": "Definitely. I'll write down the decisions: tiller rental 80, compost 50, seeds 140, total 270. And we'll meet again on June 5th to check how things are going.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "d3ff9f47a1a74f67e3e19dbd3312c801fb26af4e592810f82c414f8827414f29",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1857,
        "sourceEnd": 1945,
        "text": "Perfect. Let's also ask if anyone can donate extra seeds. That could save us some money.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "1fda40cfe81a732b474d73f1096bd72518427494d31c90970cd1b1d6a0f30b23",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1949,
        "sourceEnd": 2126,
        "text": "Good idea. I'll put a notice on the board. So, to sum up: we have 270 dollars left, we'll spend it on the tiller, compost, and seeds, and we'll review in June. Thanks, everyone.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "90ace99012601fc31fac34008a88576676a2c500c18798058e62b4e61512b916",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
